    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d69">

                <pb facs="0186" n="82" sameAs="frus:frus1932v05/pg82"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">724.3415/2188</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Commission of Neutrals to the Bolivian Minister for
                        Foreign Affairs (Gutiérrez)</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Translation]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1932-08-31">August 31,
                        1932</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>The Commission of Neutrals has received with pleasure Your Excellency’s reply in
                    which you accept the suspension of hostilities for 30 days, and which it is
                    transmitting to Paraguay.</p>
                <p>The opportunity is taken to advise you, in reply to Your Excellency’s cablegram,
                    that the doctrine of August 3 does not have an exceptional character but is
                    applicable to this and to all other future cases.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Francis White</hi>
                    </signed>
                    <lb/>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">President of the Commission of Neutrals</hi>
                    <lb/>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">J. Varela</hi>
                    </signed>
                    <lb/>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Minister of Uruguay</hi>
                    <lb/>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Fabio Lozano T.</hi>
                    </signed>
                    <lb/>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Minister of Colombia</hi>
                    <lb/>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">José T. Barón</hi>
                    </signed>
                    <lb/>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Chargé d’Affaires of Cuba</hi>
                    <lb/>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">P. Herrera de Huerta</hi>
                    </signed>
                    <lb/>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Chargé d’Affaires of Mexico</hi>
                </closer>
            </div>
